{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10284190","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10284190","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1028419001:0":{"text":"西奥多说他把两位植物学家送到了这个路口，才和他们分开的。","source_cn":"西奥多说他把两位植物学家送到了这个路口，才和他们分开的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFCD471D0DA3876B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1028419002:1":{"text":"奇怪，之前找采集队的时候，满满没看到有足迹往塔兰村去。","source_cn":"奇怪，之前找采集队的时候，满满没看到有足迹往塔兰村去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA664F7DF8872B5FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028419003:1":{"text":"明明路上有很多足迹，你是不是看错了？","source_cn":"明明路上有很多足迹，你是不是看错了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BB6C265A9ACF7E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028419004:1":{"text":"满满才不会看错呢！方向满满还是能认清楚！","source_cn":"满满才不会看错呢！方向满满还是能认清楚！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE795A2A84B106DBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028419005:2":{"text":"……难道那两位植物学家难道真走错了路，跑到更远的岔路上了？","source_cn":"……难道那两位植物学家难道真走错了路，跑到更远的岔路上了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27922DCDCBEF9186","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn"